## What this license covers

Only material generated by this repository:

* synthesised episodes, paired context/query scenarios and evaluation
  payloads for the nine capability tasks (speed, door, action_delay,
  action_strength, contact_friction, motion_damping, portal_exit,
  robot_arm_mass, cube_gripper_carry);
* the catalogs, manifests, split declarations and build reports that describe
  them;
* frozen evaluation results, scoreboards and receipts produced from them.


